window.products.push({"id":730092,"name":"Chef'n Natural Charcoal Compost Filter, Dimensions - oval, approx. 6-1/2 x 5 inches, 3/8 inch thick, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ardt96JgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keep extra filters on hand for your Chef'n EcoCrock Compost Bin. These replacement filters effectively remove odors. Keep your kitchen composting solution smelling fresh with these charcoal filters. These filters ship as a set of 2. Charcoal acts as one of nature's most effective natural filters. Choose smart, easy-to-use kitchen utensils that are built on tasteful design, new technologies, and the trusted reputation of Chef'n.HOW TO USE:Place filter in vented lid of compost bin. Attach strap to hold filter in place. Chef’n tools and gadgets are designed to be powerful in their simplicity, so that you can delight in simple food prep tasks as much as in the moments spent around the table. Less time prepping, more time enjoying. We create products that make experimentation in the kitchen approachable and fun for the chef in all of us. We aim to inspire creativity and shareable experiences in the kitchen. Our tools are approachable so that everyone can experience a healthy-ish lifestyle through intentional at-home food prep. The Chef’n design team focuses on solving problems in the kitchen with innovative, clever solutions. The result is high quality, well designed products that promote and encourage cooking and eating with family and friends at home. We want food prep to be less tedious and more enjoyable for you so that time in your kitchen can be a delicious experience to share. With playful prep and clever cooking let’s make healthy meals and happy kitchens!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ardt96JgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B01K26INRI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K26INRI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K26INRI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730093,"name":"Freestanding Paper Towel Holder Countertop - Stainless Steel Paper Towel Holder - for Standard or Large Paper Towel Roll –Sturdy Anti-Slip/Scratch Bas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714ed0opi8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ THE ONLY PAPER TOWEL HOLDER YOU'LL EVER NEED - This sleek and sturdy kitchen towel holder is crafted in high-quality, durable stainless steel, making it super long-lasting. Many papertowel holders on the market are made of plastic with flimsy construction, but this stainless steel paper towel holder will never break or tip over. The high-quality design promises it will hold up through years of repeated use. ✅ SUPER EASY TO USE - The quick-release top knob of this paper towel holder makes replacing rolls as easy as ever. With just a quick push of the button, the top knob comes off—one step is all it takes. Grabbing the top knob is also a handy and convenient way to move the paper towel stand anywhere you’d like. ✅ FREE-STANDING, NO-SLIP DESIGN - How many paper towel holders have you used that tip or move positions instantly with just a tug of a paper towel? Due to a heavy-duty weighted base and no-slip/no-scratch bottom, this paper towel dispenser countertop stays put and doesn't tip over. You’ll be able to grab a paper towel quickly without creating any more of a mess. ✅ COMPLEMENTS ANY DECOR - The sleek look of this paper towels holder will fit perfectly in any kitchen. The brushed stainless steel finish offers an attractive neutral look that blends with any color scheme or theme. If you are searching for a black paper towel holder to match dark accents in your kitchen, the black details at the knob will coordinate perfectly. ✅ A GREAT GIFT & INCLUDES FREE PAPER TOWEL ROLL - Paper towel holders make great gifts for housewarming occasions or wedding showers. Don’t give a boring, plastic white paper towel holder—choose this sleek paper towel holder stainless steel that elevates any home decor. Plus, a gift comes with it: You’ll get a paper towel roll FREE with your purchase!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714ed0opi8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LÖFFEL","source_asin":"B083LM7YM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083LM7YM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083LM7YM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
