window.products.push({"id":730166,"name":"Blessed Day Bird of Paradise Canvas Wall Art Print, Floral Artwork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716QCI--jsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SIZE: 36\" W x 36\" H x 1.25\" D. Orientation of canvas is square. READY TO HANG: Canvas comes with pre-installed hanging hardware already attached to the back of the product, so all that remains once received is hanging a nail on your wall for final installation. Infographic for hardware shown in product images. MADE IN USA: Canvas is handcrafted and made-to-order in the United States using high quality artist-grade canvas and archival inks that prevent against fading and preserve as much fine detail and vivid color as possible. Product also comes with a finished back. PERFECT FOR ANY SPACE: Living room, family room, bedroom, bathroom, office, kitchen, dining room, game room, bar, and more! SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Please note that screens can vary in color and brightness, which can cause some printed products to appear slightly different from the online preview. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, please contact us directly through your order history and we would be more than happy to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716QCI--jsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANVAS ON DEMAND","source_asin":"B084GCV3S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084GCV3S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084GCV3S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730167,"name":"Dwellbee Tres 17 Gallon Corner Laundry Hamper (23.5 x 13.8, 23.5\" x 13.8\" x 13.8\", Dark Brown Bamboo, Light Blue Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nyLNHvFTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DWELLBEE • \\dwell•bee\\ At one point during our product development process, we asked ourselves one simple question: What makes a product great? It seemed silly that it had taken us so long to ask such a simple question. We had been tinkering around with materials and making various products for years before it dawned on us. After much thought and deliberation, we came up with a list of core elements that we found are the most important in achieving a top-tier product. These elements are QUALITY, INTENTION, SIMPLICITY, CONSISTENCY, and BEAUTY.Inspired and excited, we rethought every step of our design process and began making products that embodied our core elements. We didn’t want to add another uninspired product to the already congested marketplace. It boils down to one thing: We want products that inspire our customers as well as ourselves. There is no point in bringing another mediocre product into this world. MATERIALS, DIMENSIONS, and CAPACITY The Tres hamper is crafted out of bamboo, a rapidly renewable resource. Bamboo is a grass and grows 3-5 times faster than traditional timber. This makes it the perfect candidate for responsibly creating sustainable products.The Tres hamper is an ultra-compact 23.5” x 13.8” x 13.8” (60 cm x 35 cm x 35 cm) and holds an incredible 17 gallons. QUALITY GUARANTEE We believe in our products.Did you receive a damaged item? Don't worry, 99% of the time this damage occurs during shipping. Our quality guarantee covers all damage related to shipping and ensures the product to be free of defects and faulty craftsmanship. If for any reason the quality of your product doesn't meet your expectations, please contact us immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nyLNHvFTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dwellbee","source_asin":"B01J6F2FPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J6F2FPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J6F2FPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
