window.products.push({"id":730179,"name":"Vellgoo 4,500 Sq.Ft Energy Star Dehumidifier for Basement with Drain Hose, 52 Pint DryTank Dehumidifiers for Home Large Room, Intelligent Humidity Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5197m-feWPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENERGY STAR & 52-PINT POWERFUL MOISTURE ABSORPTION: Up to 4,500 sq. ft dehumidifier for basement removes 52 pints per day (86°F, 80% RH) depending on moisture condition and adjust humidity from 40% to 80%. Energy Star verified, our dehumidifiers have lower operating costs, and is kinder to the environment. Ideal for basements, laundry, bathroom, garage, office, stockroom, cellars, etc. It's important to choose a efficient dehumidifier MOST EFFICIENT 2023 ENERGY STAR: Vellgoo dehumidifier are recognized as ENERGY STAR Most Efficient deliver cutting edge energy efficiency along with the latest in technological innovation. They represent the very best for energy savings and environmental protection. Thank you for your contribution for evergy savings and environmental protection SET THE HUMIDITY YOU WANT & ENJOY PEACEFUL NIGHT: The dehumidifier will stop working or restart automatically when the dehumidifier reaches the set humidity or the humidity is higher than the target humidity; The bucket full indicator with the silent reminders will always be on and shut off automatically, don't need to worry about keeping alarm to wake you up. Enjoy peaceful and sweet sleep all night PORTABLE DRAINAGE WITHOUT THE HASSLE: Easy Empty the water tank (5.5L/1.4Gal) with carrying handle; Tired of emptying water? - The dehumidifier with drain hose (6.56-foot ) help you keep continuous drainage; The hose is not long enough? - There is also a hose adapter to connect to the garden hose as a welcome gift with your purchase MULTIPLE HUMANIZED DESIGN: The dehumidifiers for large room have 2 modes of dehumidification switch freely (Continuous Mode, Customed Mode); built-in universal wheels and handle easy to move; automatic restart and automatic defrost; thoughtful child lock design, safety protection; removable washable reusable filter makes your life so comfortable WHY VELLGOO? Adhere to the pursuit of excellent quality, use high-quality environmentally friendly materials, adopt core rotary compression technology, and pass the Energy Star certification, FCC certification and ETL certification, so that your safety is fully guaranteed EXCELLENT CUSTOMER SUPPORT: We have great confidence in our products, so we provide 1-year warranty, 2-year extended warranty for the product (extendable up to 2 years, see user manual for details) and 5-year warranty for compressors. Please feel free to contact us if there is any question, we promise we will get back to you within 24 hours (working day). Our door is always open","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5197m-feWPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vellgoo","source_asin":"B0BRKFSKRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRKFSKRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRKFSKRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
