window.products.push({"id":730233,"name":"FUNGYAND Training Chopsticks for Beginners Including 4 Pairs Learning Chopsticks with Attachable Learning Chopstick Helper,4 Pieces Reusable Silicone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ejhg8T0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The advantages of using chopsticks: 1. Strengthening the fine coordination of hand movements: Using chopsticks is a delicate exercise involving more than 30 joints, including shoulder, arm, wrist, palm and finger, and more than 50 muscles. It is a good opportunity to exercise hand function. 2. Promoting visual development: Before using chopsticks to get food, it is inseparable from the visual orientation of the eyes. Frequent use of chopsticks can promote visual development, which is helpful to prevent strabismus and amblyopia. 3. Brain-building and Intelligence-developing: The use of chopsticks depends on the fine movements of the hands, the visual positioning of the eyes and the coordination ability of the brain. Frequent use of chopsticks is beneficial to the development of the brain, thus beneficial for brain-building and intelligence-developing. Learn how to use chopsticks and make mealtime fun with these training chopsticks! Chopsticks tailer-made for beginners and novices are very suitable for anyone who want to learn how to use them. These chopsticks are interesting, simple and easy to use. For beginners, you can use them together with finger rings first. When you get familiar with them, you can detach the finger rings and rely solely on the silicone animals at the top of the chopsticks. When you are completely proficient, you can remove the silica gel animal at the top and make yourself a master of chopsticks. Feature: Quantity: 9 Pieces Size: Chopstick 18cm straw Colour: Pink, Yellow, Blue, Green Material: Melamine (chopsticks)and,Silicone(animal toppers) Included in color box: 4 x Training Chopsticks with Silicone finger ring 4 x Silicone Straws 1 x Cleaning Brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ejhg8T0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUNGYAND","source_asin":"B07ZB44KSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZB44KSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZB44KSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
