window.products.push({"id":730261,"name":"Creative Co-Op Gold Electroplated Stainless Steel Oil Cruet with Cork Lid Serveware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Io2UC6-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With gold electroplating, this stainless steel oil cruet is a beauty. The thick cork lid on top adds character along with the rounded handle. It is the perfect size with the ability to hold sixteen ounces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Io2UC6-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Co-Op","source_asin":"B07VBNF97C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBNF97C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBNF97C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730262,"name":"Deluxe Popcorn Maker by American Era","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pF5nMNSZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Theater Style Popcorn the old-fashion way with this Deluxe Popcorn Maker by American Era. Uses hot air, not oil for a healthy low-calorie treat for the whole family. Use the included butter warmer to add additional flavor just like at the movies. Popper sets up in minutes and cleans up easy with soap and water. Remember this is an air popper. Air poppers work with a flow of super hot air circulating through the kernels. Because of the way air poppers heat verses oil poppers, the popcorn is lighter, fluffier and much healthier. The only downside of an air popper is that it does produce a few more unpopped kernels. The overall cost to make popcorn is reduced because you don't need to purchase oil. You won't find a better popcorn maker for the price. This is a low price great value item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pF5nMNSZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AE","source_asin":"B00DHKRNVE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DHKRNVE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DHKRNVE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730263,"name":"FRESHY CHEF Wooden Salad Bowl - 3 Piece Set - Large Acacia Wood Salad Bowl with Serving Hands - Handmade with Natural Wood -Also Works as Fruit Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YWycQdY0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It’s Friday night and you’re having friends over for dinner. You’re certain they’ll love the sizzling steak. You’re sure they’ll relish your signature garlic mashed potatoes. But you’ve got no doubt in your mind what the star of the night will be - your Freshy Chef acacia salad bowl! With an exquisite wood grain, deep rich color, and a premium heft, this wood serving bowl transforms every meal into an experience. Fill it with your favorite salad, center it on the dining table, and watch the praise follow. And you won’t just be getting an elegant salad serving bowl; each 3-piece set includes a pair of salad hands. Unlike other serving spoons that need to be placed on an extra plate, our salad hands hang right on the edge of the bowl for a beautiful presentation. Product Specifications: Size: Large Color: Natural Weight: 28.9oz Serves: 4-8 People Material: Acacia Wood Dimensions: 11.8” X 11.8” x 4.7 Inches Package Inclusions: 2 x Salad Hands 1 x Wooden Salad Bowl Quality You’ll Want to Flaunt We set out to create a wood salad bowl that could withstand years of scrumptiousness. One that would crown countless dinner parties. By combining the finest acacia and expert craftsmanship, we managed to do just that. Caring for your attention-grabber will be easy. Simply wash by hand and wipe dry as soon as possible. Occasionally rub in some oil to keep it looking great. (Not safe to use in the dishwasher, microwave, or fridge. Do not soak) This beauty loves salads, but you can also use one as a wooden fruit bowl, coffee table centerpiece, a serving bowl for popcorn, or a smile-sparking gift to appreciate the passionate cook or entertainer in your life. Go ahead, discover the versatility!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YWycQdY0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRESHY CHEF","source_asin":"B09W8Q3JY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W8Q3JY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W8Q3JY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730264,"name":"Urban Naturals Black Vanilla Oak Reed Diffuser Gift Set. with Warm Vanilla, Oak, Cedar, Patchouli and Musk Scent Notes. A Sensual, Aromatic Home Fragr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZxJhGPTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Urban Naturals Black Vanilla Oak is a blend of warm vanilla enveloped with oak, cedar, patchouli and musk. Warmth and richness will be infused throughout your space when you use this reed diffuser. NATURAL, ELEGANT & SAFE Reed diffusers will become your favorite way to fragrance your home; they do not need to be lit and can decorate any space, leaving your home smelling fresh 3-4months. No flame or heat required Unlike candles, reed diffusers do not require a flame, making it a much safer way to scent any room. Smoke-free Incense is very nice, but the smoke from incense is not. Reed diffusers achieve the same results without any smoke. Without wax or ash Incense leaves ash; candles leave wax. Reed diffusers leave neither. Heat-free Heat-activated air fresheners such as the ones that plug into power points damage the essence of the fragrances; reed diffusers protect and maintain them. Expert Tips: Position in the room of your choice and remove the cork carefully. Place the sticks inside the neck of the bottle spaced out for optimal diffusion. The scent will infuse into the air and provide a lasting scent. Place the bottle on a high shelf away from children and animals. Important: Do not spill oil on wood or finished surfaces as all diffuser oils will damage furniture and surfaces. Note from Urban Naturals: We understand that scent is a personal preference and while this scent may be appealing to some, it may not be appealing to others. We'd love to help you find the right scent. Please contact us for recommendations. 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE If you don't absolutely love our product, let us know and receive a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZxJhGPTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Naturals","source_asin":"B09GXRHX78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXRHX78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXRHX78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
