window.products.push({"id":730363,"name":"Personalized Friends Ornaments for Christmas Tree – Polyresin BFF Besties Ornament – Charming Long-Distance Friendship Gifts – Friendsgiving Decoratio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OLDerGCLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Sisters Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our best friend ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of 3 girls! This Holiday season, show off how much your best friend means to you with our special and sweet friendship ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized best friend Christmas ornaments often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. All our 2022 best friends’ ornaments are delicately hand painted to ensure a unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND best friends quarantine ornament and best friend keepsakes you’ll always cherish. Give the Gift of Joy – and savor life’s biggest moments as you celebrate your friendship with your bestie with this best friend Christmas ornament! Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your unique best friends’ decor will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your family home. This special ornament is the perfect way to commemorate a friendship that will last forever. The ultimate present for the special person in your life! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our best friends decorations make beautiful, unique BFF gifts, best friend birthday gifts, un-biological sister gift, friends party decorations, friendship day gifts and sentimental gifts for friend to cherish every Holiday season. Your friends’ ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect gifts for best friend to create loving memories that will surely be cherished forever! Happy Besties – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful best friends and sisters Christmas ornaments for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your Christmas ornament for a friend 2022, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OLDerGCLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B08TMTHL6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMTHL6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMTHL6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
