window.products.push({"id":730401,"name":"Drinking Glasses with Bamboo Lids and Straw 4pcs Set, 16oz-Beer Can Glass, Iced Coffee Glasses, Can Shaped Glass Cups with Lids and Straws for Boba Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M6mWJVoqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 PCS GLASS CUP WITH BAMBOO LID AND STRAW SET】Glass can cup set includes 4 can-shaped glass cups (Diameter - 3 inches, Height - 5.8 inches, holding liquid of 16oz), 4 nature bamboo lids, 4 reusable glass straws (the length of straw is 8.5 inches meaning you still have proper length left even insert in the glass fully), 2 cleaning brushes for straws, 1 cleaning brush for cups, Classic design, Very practical combination suit. 【DURABLE & SAFE】 The can glasses are made of high-quality borosilicate glass, Lead-free and BPA-free. It can be used safely for a long time. This thick clear glass can withstand the temperature difference between -4°F to 176°F. It is safe to store in the microwave or in the refrigerator. The transparent and smooth surface is perfect for DIY and decorate. 【SIMPLE MODERN BEER CAN GLASSES DESIGN】The whole looking of this glassware with modern and stylish shape, is designed to replicate a beer can to capture rich foam and aroma of a delicious soda or beer, impact your drinking experience. It caters to the way you used to holding beer cans, so it is very handy to grab and toast for gracious entertaining. 【MULTI-PURPOSE】 These can glasses are widely loved by families, kitchen, breweries, cafes, bars and restaurants. You can use it to make perfect tea, boba bubble Pearl Milk Tea, soda, water, iced coffee, smoothie, fruit juice or any other interesting holiday drinks. 【AMAZING GIFT】 This glass coffee cups with lids and straw set are packaged in a gift box, which is very fashionable, beautiful and characteristic. Perfect for Birthdays, House warming gifts, Tea Sets, Home Bars, Graduation, Weddings, Bachelorette Parties and Christmas Gifts. 【100% SATISFIED SERVICE】 This glass set is packaged in the heavy bubble holder and thick carton box to prevent damage while in transport. If the can-shaped glass set you received was damaged or imperfect or you are not 100% satisfied, please simply contact us, we are available 24/7, and will offer a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M6mWJVoqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TETSMG","source_asin":"B0BFPNJV3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFPNJV3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFPNJV3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
