window.products.push({"id":730757,"name":"RosyOcean Universal Compatible with All Shop Vacs Extractor Attachment with 2-1/2\" & 1-7/8\" & 1-1/4\" Three Adapters Auto Detailing Vacuum Head Extract","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WlWatjUlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍁COMPATIBLE WITH ALL SHOP VACS: Our unique adapters connect this extraction tool to all brands' shop vacuum cleaners from 1 gallon to 26 gallon. 1-1/4\" adapter fits shop vac in 1-5 gal. 1-7/8\" adapter fits wet vac in 5-9 gallon, but for Rigid vac from 3-9 gal. 2-1/2\" adapter fits wet dry vacuum cleaner in 10-26 gal. Don't worry and needn't check whether this tool fit your wet/dry vac or not, just pick up it today. This clear extractor tool works with any existing wet-dry vac you already have 🍁UNBREAKABLE SEE-THROUGH HEAD: This clear head is made from special premium materials and will not breakable even your automobile roll on it. Don’t worry to drop it anywhere, it is unbreakable! The transparent head lets you view the whole cleaning process and effect, see the dirt and impurities being cleaned. This small 3-1/2” width nozzle extract stains from stairs, car interiors, upholstery, mats, boats as well as all those other hard to reach place 🍁 EASY TO INSTALL & REUSE: Our unique adapters connect the tool to both hose cuff and extension wand of shop vac. Just plug in, turn shop vac to an extractor immediately. The three adapters are no inside threads, no need destroy your hose cuff, your hose cuff could still fit original accessories of your shop vac. We developed this extractor tool to ensure you clean up with improved accuracy and efficiency in your house, in your car, and everywhere you need a little fine-tuned detailing 🍁DIY A CARPET EXTRACTOR: If you’ve got a shop vac you need a professional extract tool that enhances your suction capabilities and cleans things up quickly and easily. Our unique adapters help to convert any existing shop vac into a powerful extractor. You can therefore save the expensive cost of a pro extractor. A great alternative to buy a professional extractor. Don’t waste your money or overspend on “Pro” extractors. Harness the power of your shop vac! 🍁 IMPROVED COMPATIBILITY: The standard IDM 1-/2” of clear nozzle and standard 1-1/2\" vacuum tubing are compatible with portable extractor & truck mount and most carpet cleaning system for optimal cleaning support. This shampoo tool offers long-lasting durability and resilience, so you can continue to use it for personal or professional use on tons of indoor and automobile projects","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WlWatjUlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RosyOcean","source_asin":"B0C5QZ4GCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5QZ4GCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5QZ4GCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
