window.products.push({"id":730790,"name":"Bell'O HTS103BK No-Arm Reclining Chair (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D+TXzfBiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description No-Arm Reclining Chair has no arms and is used to make row, sofa or arc configurations. There are connectors on both sides of the chair for attachment to an adjacent chair or component. Leather and leather-matched materials. Amazon.com This beautiful no-arm recliner is constructed of luxurious leather on all touch surfaces, providing optimum support and positioning for home theater viewing. The Leggett & Platt® Zero Wall reclining mechanism requires only 3\" of reclining space for smooth and compact reclining. The cleverly hidden fingertip-controlled reclining mechanism lever activates the reclining system with just a touch. Typically used to make row, sofa, or arc configurations, this recliner provides connectors on both sides for easy attachment to another chair or component. From the Manufacturer Bell'O International, a leading designer and manufacturer of A/V furniture, provides the next wave of sophistication for your media room with the ultimate in home theater seating: the HTS-100. With a combination of stylish, contemporary looks and superior ergonomics and functionality, its no wonder that the HTS-100 Home Theatre Seating System is the recipient of the 2007 Electronic House Product of the Year Award. The HTS-100 is the paramount solution to turn a run-of-the-mill den into the ultimate media room. Add extra pieces (sold separately)for a variety of seating options. View Larger HTS-100 transforms any media room into an elegant cinema. View Larger HTS-100 in a 3-seat arc configuration. View Larger Impeccable Craftsmanship and Design The BellO HTS-100 Home Theater Seating System is designed with your viewing experience as the primary point of construction. Created with the highest quality, hand-selected materials, the HTS-100 is supple to the touch, yet durable enough to withstand the normal wear and tear of family life. Genuine leather on all touch surfaces and leather matched materials with elegant tailoring from all angles makes the HTS-100 beautiful from all sides, and allows for confident placement anywhere in the room. The HTS-100 is available in both brown and black finishes, and many components are offered to create multiple configurations for any home theater setting.   The ingenious ergonomic design of the HTS-100 headrest and seat-back keep your eyes at the optimum viewing position, regardless of recline position. Additional neck and back support wrap you in supreme comfort during long viewing sessions. All HTS-100 chairs come equipped with a sophisticated Leggett & Platt® reclining mechanism for smooth, quiet, and durable reclining. A tiny, hidden finger-tip lever controls the reclining mechanism with ease, allowing the chair to sink into a full, luxurious recline that only requires 3\" of space from a rear wall. Further, the HTS-100 features removable stainless steel cup-holders in the seats arms, giving you both functionality and convenience. Additionally, the HTS-100 is backed by a one-year in-home warranty. A Myriad of Configuration Options To maximize comfort and convenience for the whole family, the HTS-100 offers you the option to connect to other BellO pieces to create the ultimate home theater sofa. HTS-100 chairs are available in double, left, right, and no-arm models to give you flexibility in creating your personalized seating solution. Wedge and under-seat connectors are also available to achieve the look and feel of a mini movie theater in your home.   Many different combinations are possible with the HTS-100 system. Connect a left and right-arm model together to create a cozy reclining loveseat. Add a no-arm seat in between the two to make a 3-seat sofa recliner. Two double-arm chairs with a no-arm model between them create a compact row of theater-style seats. Or, for the ultimate in theater seating, use HTS-100 wedge connectors to create a wide arc of luxurious, leather-wrapped recliners. Separate or combined together, the HTS-100 can transform any den or media room into an elegant, comfortable cinema space. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D+TXzfBiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bell'O","source_asin":"B000X35MG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000X35MG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000X35MG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
