window.products.push({"id":730932,"name":"Lavish Home Turtles Wall Art with Shells and Starfish Nautical 3D Metal Hanging Decor-Vintage Coastal Under Water Sea Life Ocean Home Artwork, (L) 28”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zfZVcPeuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Swimming Sea Turtles Wall Art will add a whimsical seaside touch to any home decor! Featuring an intricately crafted openwork design of scrolled waves, and 4 swimming turtles with starfish and seashell accents, this hand painted 3D metal artwork is a unique ocean sea life inspired piece that will make an attractive addition to any home. It will beautifully complement any design style, from vintage nautical or rustic coastal cottage, to modern contemporary. With a built-in wall hanger on the back and mounting hardware included, this wall sculpture will look fantastic in the living room, bedroom, bathroom, hallway, foyer, or any area of the home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zfZVcPeuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavish Home","source_asin":"B07L5G7DP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5G7DP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5G7DP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730933,"name":"USSR coat of arms Russian tea glass holder Podstakannik Soviet design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EMNxK+L1L._AC_SL1124_.jpg","description":"Russian traditional tea glass holder (nickel-plated) ★ Design: Coat of arms of the USSR ★ Contemporary, new in perfect condition. A glass is not included (any glass 2.75 \"/ 67mm diameter or slightly less is OK) ★ This original Russian Podstakannik made in Kolchugino, the famous Russian metal art manufacture. ★ The podstakannik, or tea glass holder, is a holder with a handle, most commonly made of metal that holds a drinking glass. Their primary purpose is to be able to hold a very hot glass of tea, which is usually consumed right after it is brewed. It is a traditional way of serving and drinking tea in Russia and other post-Soviet states. ★ Podstakanniks appeared in Russian tea culture in the late 18th century, when drinking tea became common in Russia. Very soon they became not just practical utensils, but also works of art, just like samovars that were used for boiling water. Expensive podstakanniks for the rich and the elite were made of silver; however, they were not very practical, since they would get quite hot very quickly due to the high thermal conductivity of silver. ★ By the 20th century, podstakanniks became very widespread. In the Soviet Union they were made mostly from nickel silver, cupronickel, and other alloys with nickel, silver, or gold plating. Though in modern times, simple tea cups or mugs are typically used by Russians at home, podstakanniks continue to be widely used for serving tea on the Russian Railways, since they provide more safety while drinking or carrying tea on a moving train. ★ Most Russian tea glass holders have been produced by a plant located in Kolchugino, continues to be the main glass holder producer to this day. ★ Worldwide Shipping Registered Airmail - Includes Tracking Number ★ Thanks for your time ★","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EMNxK+L1L._AC_SL1124_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kolchugino","source_asin":"B00GTW0Z6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GTW0Z6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GTW0Z6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
