window.products.push({"id":730961,"name":"RANCOVY Jar Sealer for FoodSaver Vacuum Sealer, Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer Kit for Regular and Wide Mouth Mason Jars, Canning Jar Sealer with Accessory H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vBsO6iNDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Only Compatible With FoodSaver: Jar vacuum sealer with an accessory hose only used for FoodSaver Vacuum Sealer Machine with an accessory port. Not for other brands of vacuum machines. Please check your vacuum sealer machine compatibility Note: RANCOVY silicone hose is Not Compatible with these models of FoodSaver: FM2000, FM2100, FM2500, FM4800, FM4900, FM 5800; VS0160, VS1130, VS0100, VS0150. If your FoodSaver vacuum machine is of the above type, please use the hose that comes with the FoodSaver vacuum machine)! Jar Sealer for Mason Jars: Jar sealer with 2 sizes are suitable for wide mouth and regular mouth mason jars. Creates an effective vacuum seal for jars that locks out air, which is ideal for sealing liquids, fragile foods, and dry foods. Environmentally Safe: Jar sealers are made with BPA-free plastic, non-toxic and odorless, food safe and are odor-proof and stain-resistant. Super durable, shatter-proof, crack-proof. Vacuum airtight preserve the freshness of all kind food, prevent odor stain and moisture loss. Complete Sealer Kit: 1*Wide Mouth Sealer, 1*Regular Mouth Sealer, 1*Hose Connector (for Foodsaver Vacuum Sealer Machine) 1*User Guide. (Mason jars are not included). If any questions, please feel free to contact us for a solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vBsO6iNDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RANCOVY","source_asin":"B0B685YTQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B685YTQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B685YTQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730962,"name":"GENWEI Can Opener, Can Opener Manual Kitchen Manual Can Opener Built in Bottle Opener (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zYYHldicL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With one tin opener at hand, opening cans and bottles are no longer headaches. Our Can Opener with key benefits: Multifunctional Can Openers, It fits for all-size cans. Just turn the knob along the edge of the can to easily open the can and save effort. The handle conforms to the shape of the hand, which is comfortable and non-slip, and has a convenient tail hanging hole. The cutting blade is sharp and durable, the cut cans are smooth and flat, no shaving, safe. Large stainless steel rotating handle, comfortable feel, improve grip, use less effort Ergonomically designed handle, ideal for seniors or people with joint issues. What can this multifunctional can opener do? This Opener can be used on tin can, oil can, milk can, cat dog food can, metal can, aluminum can, beer can, small can, large can, round can, square can, water bottle, jar etc. Kindly notes for safety and maintenance 1.Be careful the sharp blade in case of getting fingers hurt. 2.The opened lid is sharp enough to hurt fingers. 3.Not suitable for kids. 4.Wash it under running water, wipe off the can opener and dry it after cleaning. Store it at dry places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zYYHldicL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GENWEI","source_asin":"B099KBRDHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KBRDHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KBRDHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":730963,"name":"Deny Designs Valentina Ramos Its All In Your Head Shower Curtain, 69 x 72","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c-p24eF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who says bathrooms can't be fun? To get the most bang for your buck, start with an artistic, inventive shower curtain. This woven polyester shower curtain features a vibrant printed front and white back and includes 12 buttonhole openings at the top (rings not included). While water resistant, we recommend using a clear shower curtain liners for best results (liner not included). Based in Denver, Colorado, Deny Designs is a modern, think-outside-the-box home furnishings company. Deny empowers its customers to transform dull, everyday household accessories into fun and original statement. With each purchase, our team of talented artists earn part of the proceeds, enabling Deny to support art communities all over the world while also spreading the creative love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c-p24eF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deny Designs","source_asin":"B008AJKC5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-730963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008AJKC5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008AJKC5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
